aghelm

aghelm is a modified version of agent-manager
(https://github.com/YoanWai/agent-manager), distributed under the same
Apache License, Version 2.0. The modifications rename the program and its
module, binary, tmux socket, configuration directory, MCP server name,
environment variables and generated files so that it runs beside
agent-manager; remove the self-updater, the release and message feeds, and
the issue reporter; and replace the continuous integration and release
setup with a local `make check`.
